 the second divorce, she will not be lawful for him until she has taken another husband; if that one divorces her, there will be no blame if she and the first husband return to one another, provided they feel that they can keep within the bounds set by God. These are God’s bounds, which He makes clear for those who know.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَإِن","en_gloss":"Then if","transliteration":"fa-in","verse_key":"2:230"},{"pos":2,"ar":"طَلَّقَهَا","en_gloss":"he divorces her","transliteration":"ṭallaqahā","verse_key":"2:230"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَلَا","en_gloss":"then (she is) not","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"2:230"},{"pos":4,"ar":"تَحِلُّ","en_gloss":"lawful","transliteration":"taḥillu","verse_key":"2:230"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"for him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"2:230"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:230"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بَعْدُ","en_gloss":"after (that)","transliteration":"baʿdu","verse_key":"2:230"},{"pos":8,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"2:230"},{"pos":9,"ar":"تَنكِحَ","en_gloss":"she marries","transliteration":"tankiḥa","verse_key":"2:230"},{"pos":10,"ar":"زَوْجًا","en_gloss":"a spouse","transliteration":"zawjan","verse_key":"2:230"},{"pos":11,"ar":"غَيْرَهُۥ ۗ","en_gloss":"other than him","transliteration":"ghayrahu","verse_key":"2:230"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فَإِن","en_gloss":"Then if","transliteration":"fa-in","verse_key":"2:230"},{"pos":13,"ar":"طَلَّقَهَا","en_gloss":"he divorces her","transliteration":"ṭallaqahā","verse_key":"2:230"},{"pos":14,"ar":"فَلَا","en_gloss":"then no","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"2:230"},{"pos":15,"ar":"جُنَاحَ","en_gloss":"sin","transliteration":"junāḥa","verse_key":"2:230"},{"pos":16,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمَآ","en_gloss":"on them","transliteration":"ʿalayhimā","verse_key":"2:230"},{"pos":17,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"2:230"},{"pos":18,"ar":"يَتَرَاجَعَآ","en_gloss":"they return to